## Proof Pull
P1: Treat the 77 random031 terminal certificates as a left-to-right stream over component events.
P2: Ordinary route and free-hole single certificates are immediate and need no row-name memory.
P3: Free-hole doublets need only a one-component predigit buffer, closing at the next component event.
P4: The bypass opens a four-owner carry (45,147,169,173) and HYP-3522 branch bracketing reduces it after one event to the residual pair (45,173).
P5: The remaining non-streamed proof object is exactly residual owners (45,173) plus HYP-3513 route sidecar R, not the full seven-owner seam.

